# Lens-array design as a Rekin query (ria.design).
# 37 focal lengths in [3, 16] mm; 40 working-grid points;
# objective = mean of the depth CRB [D Sec. 4].  Positions fixed, so the
# spacing/mounting constraints of [D Sec. 2] hold by construction.
